  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-素材与创意\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以获取经过一定条件过滤后的客户下创意素材库的图片及图片信息，可通过【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。\",\"id\":\"ad.image.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/image/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710601254912\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710601254912\",\"title\":\"获取图片素材\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tGDbKp0W\">通过此接口，用户可以获取经过一定条件过滤后的客户下创意素材库的图片及图片信息。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201751567298886660%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-DBPDsvss\" id=\"h346b9f0-DBPDsvss\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-qup4WYDP\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/image/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/image/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710601254912\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-7vjT0F3t\" id=\"h346b9f0-7vjT0F3t\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-gt0SCAkq\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-RX6rWZwa\" id=\"h346b9f0-RX6rWZwa\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mYb30jv4\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-LPOWI3Bj\" id=\"h346b9f0-LPOWI3Bj\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mCSFsxG9\">客户ID\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6mjA70Kn\">图片过滤条件\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">image_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5uiOkNFP\">图片ids，可以根据图片ids（创意中使用的图片key，存在一张图片对应多个image_ids的情况）进行过滤\n数量限制：&lt;=100\n注意：image_ids、material_ids、signatures只能选择一个进行过滤</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Evw6bTHc\">素材id列表，可以根据material_ids（素材报表使用的id，一个素材唯一对应一个素材id）进行过滤\n数量限制：&lt;=100\n注意：image_ids、material_ids、signatures只能选择一个进行过滤</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">signatures</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fbeb06B7\">md5值列表，可以根据素材的md5进行过滤\n数量限制：&lt;=100\n注意：image_ids、material_ids、signatures只能选择一个进行过滤</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">width</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6Ba0Ieyg\">图片宽度\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">height</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jAQ0vBPP\">图片高度\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">ratio</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pDTnJxNI\">图片宽高比，eg: [1.7, 2.5]，输入1.7则搜索满足宽高比介于1.65-1.75之间的图片，即精度上下浮动0.05\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Po9vpa5A\">根据图片上传时间进行过滤的起始时间，与end_time搭配使用，格式：yyyy-mm-dd\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PcP1fnlm\">根据图片上传时间进行过滤的截止时间，与start_time搭配使用，格式：yyyy-mm-dd\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pkOlCD6V\">页码，默认值1\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dv9aRUcn\">页面大小，默认值20\n</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-zxS0rEmg\" id=\"h346b9f0-zxS0rEmg\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Ffile%2Fimage%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_id%20%3D%20ADVERTISER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20image_ids_list%20%3D%20IMAGE_IDS%5Cn%20%20%20%20image_ids%20%3D%20json.dumps(image_ids_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20material_ids_list%20%3D%20MATERIAL_IDS%5Cn%20%20%20%20material_ids%20%3D%20json.dumps(material_ids_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20signatures_list%20%3D%20SIGNATURES%5Cn%20%20%20%20signatures%20%3D%20json.dumps(signatures_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20width%20%3D%20WIDTH%5Cn%20%20%20%20height%20%3D%20HEIGHT%5Cn%20%20%20%20ratio_list%20%3D%20RATIO%5Cn%20%20%20%20ratio%20%3D%20json.dumps(ratio_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20start_time%20%3D%20START_TIME%5Cn%20%20%20%20end_time%20%3D%20END_TIME%5Cn%20%20%20%20page%20%3D%20PAGE%5Cn%20%20%20%20page_size%20%3D%20PAGE_SIZE%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20my_args%20%3D%20%5C%22%7B%5C%5C%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22filtering%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5C%5C%5C%22image_ids%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%25s%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22material_ids%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%25s%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22signatures%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%25s%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22width%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22height%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22ratio%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%25s%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22start_time%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22end_time%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22page%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22page_size%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%7D%5C%22%20%25%20(advertiser_id%2C%20image_ids%2C%20material